  "content": "<p>模组由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fowasp.umn.edu%252falexander\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alexander Weimer</a> 创作 - \n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fa0.ax%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">网站</a> ·\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/a0ax\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> ·\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.linkedin.com%252fin%252falexander-weimer%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">领英</a> ·\n  <a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=9cVn1s0AAAAJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">谷歌学术</a> ·\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.researchgate.net%252fprofile%252fAlexander-Weimer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ResearchGate</a> ·\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252forcid.org%252f0009-0009-7313-138X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ORCiD</a> ·\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjyse.org%252farticles%252ferror-corrected-deep-learning-gregg-shorthand\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">文章</a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/r4Knci2k/images/7213f4ce1c84436eea0c31e9579395b8f1d6aefe.png\" alt=\"横幅图片\"></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/CreateInteriorsMod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/在 GitHub 上点赞-fafbfc?logo=github&amp;logoColor=black\" alt=\"点赞\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/ynQvWygqQT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-5865f2?logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"discord\"></a> </p><p><strong>Create: Interiors 是一个扩展 Create 家具选项的附加模组，现已同时支持 Forge 和 Fabric！</strong></p><h2>功能列表：</h2><h2>•   椅子方块</h2><p><em>提供全部 16 种 Minecraft 染料颜色</em></p><p><em>右键点击扳手可切换扶手状态（无、仅左、仅右或双边扶手）</em></p><p><em>合成配方：1 个彩色羊毛 + 2 个木台阶，或 1 个彩色座椅 + 1 个木台阶</em></p><p><em>可坐下，既可作为机械结构的一部分，也可单独放置</em></p><p><em>可像座椅方块一样拾取实体</em></p><p><em>有弹力！</em></p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/k1JDWLC/resized-colors.gif\" alt=\"椅子颜色\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/bJs9sQr/resized-armrests.gif\" alt=\"椅子扶手\"></p><h2>•   矮椅方块</h2><p><em>与椅子方块相同，但没有椅腿</em> </p><p><em>合成配方：1 个彩色羊毛 + 2 个木台阶，或 1 个彩色座椅 + 1 个木台阶</em></p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/RHyNcbG/Untitled.png\" alt=\"椅子颜色\"></p><h2>•   海带座椅</h2><p><em>比羊毛椅子更便宜、更易获得的替代品</em></p><p><em>合成配方：1 个干海带 + 1 个木台阶</em></p><p><em>功能与 Create 的座椅方块完全相同</em></p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/zb4mnhW/kelp-seat.png\" alt=\"海带座椅\"></p><h2>•   海带椅子</h2><p><em>比羊毛椅子更便宜、更易获得的替代品</em></p><p><em>合成配方：1 个干海带 + 2 个木台阶，或 1 个海带座椅 + 1 个木台阶</em></p><p><em>功能与彩色椅子完全相同</em></p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/71FCSBf/resized-kelp-chair.gif\" alt=\"海带扶手\"></p><h2>•   海带矮椅</h2><h2>•   座椅木板</h2><p><em>可与复制人阶梯和复制人面板配合使用，作为座椅和椅子的装饰</em></p><p><em>合成配方：2 个木台阶 + 2 个木板可制作 3 个座椅木板</em></p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rm5scrg/seatwood.png\" alt=\"座椅木板\"></p><h2>贡献者！</h2><p><strong>感谢 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lopyluna/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Luna</a> 设计精美的徽标 :)</strong></p><p><strong>感谢 <a href=\"https://github.com/AsseyGithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@AsseyGithub</a> 将 Create: Interiors 翻译为韩语。</strong> 🎉</p><p><strong>感谢 <a href=\"https://github.com/rim4oo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@rim4oo</a> 将 Create: Interiors 翻译为俄语。</strong> 🎉</p><p>## </p><h3>在 <a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/CreateInteriorsMod/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252finteriors%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 上查找 Create: Interiors</h3><h4>在<a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/CreateInteriorsMod/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>报告问题</h4><p><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/Q8SRA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VpBf0xs/interiors.png\" alt=\"Interiors 横幅\"></a></p>",
